&lt;li&gt;Work with Kotlin, Android SDK &amp;amp; Jetpack Compose, MVVM, Coroutines &amp;amp; Flow (preferred) OR RxJava, and Retrofit &amp;amp; Room&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional Android development experience building consumer Android applications at scale, preferably in Kotlin and Compose&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail, passion for writing clean, readable and maintainable code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Kotlin or Java, and Jetpack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to improve Robinhood&#39;s app and codebase to ensure outstanding quality for our all users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product sense and ability to collaborate with Product Managers and Designers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and passion for solving technical challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science or a related field preferred; equivalent training or work experience also acceptable&lt;/li&gt;
