&lt;p&gt;The Security and Technology Risk team’s mission is to protect Robinhood’s platforms, customer data, and financial systems while meeting regulatory expectations in every market we operate. In Singapore, this team plays a critical role in maintaining compliance with Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS) requirements while ensuring systems remain secure, resilient, and reliable. The team partners closely with global Security, Privacy, Engineering, Legal, Risk, and Compliance teams to align local regulatory needs with global frameworks. You will help shape how security and technology risk are managed in a regulated brokerage environment!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the APAC Security GRC Lead, you will lead the information security, cyber resilience, and technology risk management program for Robinhood Singapore. You will design and maintain a security and technology risk framework aligned with MAS Technology Risk Management Guidelines and broader regulatory expectations. As a key member of our global security office, you will work closely with enterprise teams to integrate local regulatory requirements into enterprise-wide controls, while serving as the primary contact for regulatory engagement in Singapore. This role directly influences the security, availability, and integrity of brokerage platforms, client data, and trading infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Singapore office, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
